WEBVTT

00:05.250 --> 00:09.250
<b>I've gotta head home fast, or Noda-kun and them
will drag me into something again.</b>

00:09.630 --> 00:11.750
<b>They're not all that bad, but...</b>

00:15.290 --> 00:17.000
<b>Oh, it's Tsukumo-kun.</b>

00:20.880 --> 00:22.830
<b>Well, if it isn't Hijiri-san.</b>

00:23.960 --> 00:26.880
<b>Didn't I say it's dangerous standing behind me?</b>

00:27.790 --> 00:30.880
<b>That's... not what I was trying to do at all...</b>

00:47.290 --> 00:49.670
<b>That's right, I have awakened</b>

00:49.670 --> 00:52.500
<b>I posses a special power</b>

00:52.500 --> 00:54.670
<b>Before this barrier of mine</b>

00:54.670 --> 00:59.130
<b>All are powerless</b>

01:02.210 --> 01:04.960
<b>Perhaps the reincarnation of an angel or a devil</b>

01:04.960 --> 01:07.750
<b>I can see the unseen</b>

01:07.750 --> 01:09.960
<b>My right arm is throbbing</b>

01:09.960 --> 01:12.330
<b>But I can't unleash it yet</b>

01:12.460 --> 01:15.130
<b>Neither a kid nor an adult</b>

01:15.130 --> 01:17.460
<b>Bust open some philosophy piercings</b>

01:17.460 --> 01:21.250
<b>Cassis orange, fried chicken, squeeze some lemon on and go!</b>

01:21.540 --> 01:23.830
<b>(Drink, drink, drink, drink it up!)</b>

01:24.000 --> 01:26.330
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

01:26.330 --> 01:28.830
<b>Mingled in the darkness of solitude and twisted logic</b>

01:28.830 --> 01:31.420
<b>I can't find a proper remedy</b>

01:31.420 --> 01:33.790
<b>It's the destiny of those born as men</b>

01:33.790 --> 01:36.580
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

01:36.580 --> 01:39.080
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

01:39.080 --> 01:41.500
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

01:41.500 --> 01:43.960
<b>Swaying in the gap between ideals and reality</b>

01:43.960 --> 01:46.580
<b>I don't see a solution</b>

01:46.580 --> 01:49.130
<b>If it's my fate to live for the moment</b>

01:49.130 --> 01:51.750
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

01:51.920 --> 01:54.250
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

01:54.250 --> 01:56.830
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

02:02.580 --> 02:05.170
<b>Uh... well...</b>

02:02.750 --> 02:05.630
<b>Episode 3</b>

02:02.750 --> 02:05.630
<b>Neither a Kid nor an Adult</b>

02:07.580 --> 02:11.750
<b>Do you like black coffee?
You were drinking that the other day, too.</b>

02:11.750 --> 02:16.630
<b>Well, when you add stuff,
it ruins the real flavor and aroma.</b>

02:19.170 --> 02:21.880
<b>So, why are you hanging around Noda and the others?</b>

02:22.130 --> 02:24.040
<b>I'm not "hanging around" them.</b>

02:24.830 --> 02:27.790
<b>They're such a joke, don't you think?</b>

02:28.000 --> 02:31.250
<b>One thinks he's a superhero,
one thinks he's a real pretty boy...</b>

02:31.250 --> 02:32.960
<b>And what was it, a "dark deity"?</b>

02:33.670 --> 02:35.170
<b>They make me cringe so hard.</b>

02:36.540 --> 02:38.880
<b>That's totally uncalled for.</b>

02:39.170 --> 02:42.420
<b>Then why are you in the Hero Club, Tsukumo-kun?</b>

02:44.790 --> 02:46.540
<b>It pisses me off...</b>

02:47.000 --> 02:52.500
<b>seeing fools show off when they don't know
the real terror and isolation of having superpowers.</b>

02:59.750 --> 03:00.920
<b>Huh...?</b>

03:00.920 --> 03:02.710
<b>Yo, Pink!</b>

03:04.040 --> 03:05.960
<b>Let's get over to the clubroom!</b>

03:05.960 --> 03:06.920
<b>Not on your life!</b>

03:07.080 --> 03:10.040
<b>Black says he's gonna show us something cool!</b>

03:10.040 --> 03:10.960
<b>Right?</b>

03:14.750 --> 03:17.920
<b>The time has come. The time has come.</b>

03:18.080 --> 03:20.380
<b>Why did you bring your parakeet to school?!</b>

03:20.580 --> 03:23.750
<b>The time has come. The time has come. The time-</b>

03:20.830 --> 03:23.330
<b>That's weird. Wasn't Tsukumo just here?</b>

03:23.750 --> 03:24.420
<b>Oh.</b>

03:24.420 --> 03:25.080
<b>Time?</b>

03:25.080 --> 03:25.960
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:26.880 --> 03:30.500
<b>Huh? Damn...it...</b>

03:30.500 --> 03:32.250
<b>Yo, Purple...?</b>

03:32.250 --> 03:34.460
<b>What?! Hey!</b>

03:37.500 --> 03:41.210
<b>This stupid world... it makes me want to destroy it!</b>

03:43.790 --> 03:46.210
<b>What's up with Tsukumo?</b>

03:46.380 --> 03:48.460
<b>Destroy the world...?</b>

03:48.960 --> 03:50.170
<b>Don't tell me, he...?!</b>

03:50.580 --> 03:52.750
<b>He's a spy from the Agency?</b>

03:52.750 --> 03:53.540
<b>Uh?</b>

03:53.540 --> 03:55.290
<b>But I want to believe in him!</b>

03:55.830 --> 03:58.880
<b>In the sense of justice buried within Purple!</b>

03:58.880 --> 04:01.830
<b>We'll have to assess whether he's a friend or a foe.</b>

04:02.040 --> 04:04.080
<b>Maybe we'll find something out if we follow him.</b>

04:04.080 --> 04:05.830
<b>Not again...</b>

04:06.250 --> 04:09.750
<b>Pink, don't you want to know? What his true identity is?</b>

04:10.420 --> 04:13.630
<b>Huh? I don't really...</b>

04:19.080 --> 04:20.170
<b>I'm coming.</b>

04:45.080 --> 04:47.290
<b>Guys, did you notice?!</b>

04:47.960 --> 04:53.580
<b>Of course. The crosswalks Tsukumo has crossed
have all been green. Which means...</b>

04:54.130 --> 04:55.670
<b>...he must have manipulated time!</b>

04:55.670 --> 04:57.460
<b>I think it was just a coincidence.</b>

05:00.790 --> 05:02.250
<b>Beef         Croquettes         Deli      Boxed Meals</b>

05:02.750 --> 05:06.540
<b>Hi there! We're just about to have a limited time sale.</b>

05:09.540 --> 05:15.420
<b>Fresh Produce</b>

05:10.330 --> 05:12.380
<b>Limited discounts, starting now!</b>

05:12.920 --> 05:14.920
<b>Get this cheap, right now!</b>

05:15.460 --> 05:17.880
<b>Here, a little something extra.</b>

05:20.580 --> 05:24.080
<b>How is his timing so lucky? Don't tell me...</b>

05:24.080 --> 05:25.710
<b>He really knows how to shop!</b>

05:25.920 --> 05:28.130
<b>...he can manipulate people's souls, too?</b>

05:28.130 --> 05:29.210
<b>What?!</b>

05:43.500 --> 05:44.830
<b>What are you, in elementary school?!</b>

05:45.130 --> 05:47.960
<b>He even has winged messengers under his control?!</b>

05:47.960 --> 05:49.960
<b>That's some amazing ESP!</b>

05:49.960 --> 05:52.080
<b>No, I really don't think that's it...</b>

05:52.540 --> 05:54.630
<b>Gah, stop that, stop that!</b>

05:57.290 --> 05:58.580
<b>The time has come.</b>

05:58.580 --> 05:59.330
<b>Oh.</b>

06:00.040 --> 06:02.080
<b>Faust, wait!</b>

06:02.500 --> 06:04.960
<b>Quiet, imbecile! Quiet, imbecile!</b>

06:05.630 --> 06:08.380
<b>Faust!</b>

06:09.000 --> 06:12.880
<b>Who would have thought
I would have to carry this out here.</b>

06:19.960 --> 06:26.790
<b>Due to our blood pact, Faust is obliged to return
when I sound this flute, wherever he may be.</b>

06:27.540 --> 06:29.420
<b>Wow! That's so cool!</b>

06:29.420 --> 06:31.790
<b>Those moves... He must have practiced really hard...</b>

06:37.630 --> 06:39.920
<b>Impossible! It's not working?!</b>

06:40.040 --> 06:42.540
<b>It's Purple! He got Faust, too?!</b>

06:42.540 --> 06:44.920
<b>So this is part of Tsukumo's powers too, huh?</b>

06:44.920 --> 06:51.420
<b>He manipulates souls... It's a troublesome power
but it can't affect Toga Ryushoin.</b>

06:51.750 --> 06:56.880
<b>My soul has gone through hell so many times
that it has long frozen over.</b>

06:57.630 --> 07:03.170
<b>If that's his game... I shall unleash the sword
routine of purgatory, Dante's Blade Dance!</b>

07:03.500 --> 07:04.750
<b>"Sword routine of purgatory"?</b>

07:04.750 --> 07:06.540
<b>"Dante's Blade Dance"?!</b>

07:06.880 --> 07:07.880
<b>...What's that?</b>

07:08.580 --> 07:12.250
<b>It's a dance that involves striking
the three great weapons of orihalcum</b>

07:12.580 --> 07:15.960
<b>to restore Faust's memories from his previous life!</b>

07:17.080 --> 07:18.830
<b>That just sounds so awesome!</b>

07:19.710 --> 07:25.710
<b>It's no easy task performing it in this life...
but I must find some substitute weapons.</b>

07:25.710 --> 07:27.670
<b>100 Yen Shop</b>

07:28.330 --> 07:30.380
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

07:30.710 --> 07:32.170
<b>Super cheap</b>

07:35.880 --> 07:38.080
<b>What is with this strange group of guys...?</b>

07:38.750 --> 07:42.040
<b>In this life, this should be the closest material.</b>

07:42.040 --> 07:43.630
<b>So that's how you do it?</b>

07:43.630 --> 07:45.540
<b>That's pretty easy.</b>

07:46.380 --> 07:48.080
<b>The three great weapons are super cheap!</b>

07:48.920 --> 07:53.130
<b>Killer strike! Sword-blade... Strash!</b>

07:53.130 --> 07:55.080
<b>No! Our swords!</b>

07:55.960 --> 07:58.080
<b>Th-the three great weapons...!</b>

07:58.330 --> 08:03.130
<b>Don't give up! My soul hasn't broken yet!</b>

08:03.880 --> 08:05.580
<b>There's a fourth one now?!</b>

08:05.830 --> 08:07.290
<b>I knew we could count on you!</b>

08:07.290 --> 08:09.130
<b>I'm Red, after all!</b>

08:09.920 --> 08:12.130
<b>Can I go home now?</b>

08:12.130 --> 08:14.040
<b>Oh? You kids there...</b>

08:14.540 --> 08:17.380
<b>We're not doing anything shady!
There's a reason for this!</b>

08:17.380 --> 08:20.420
<b>Thanks for getting my kettle the other day.</b>

08:20.750 --> 08:22.380
<b>Out doing club activities again?</b>

08:22.380 --> 08:27.960
<b>Goddess of the harvest. Have you seen Faust,
descendant of the red crimson phoenix?</b>

08:27.960 --> 08:30.880
<b>Old Lady Yone, have you seen a blue parakeet?</b>

08:31.500 --> 08:34.080
<b>Hmm, can't say I have...</b>

08:34.080 --> 08:36.210
<b>Okay, I see. Thanks anyway.</b>

08:36.210 --> 08:38.920
<b>Huh? People actually know about them around town?</b>

08:39.920 --> 08:41.670
<b>That was our last hope...</b>

08:41.880 --> 08:45.290
<b>In that case, I have no choice but to use that skill!</b>

08:47.330 --> 08:48.830
<b>That pose...!</b>

08:49.210 --> 08:52.330
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate...</b>

08:53.040 --> 08:55.460
<b>...Searchlight!</b>

08:57.460 --> 08:59.830
<b>What does he think he's seeing?</b>

09:03.500 --> 09:04.420
<b>This way!</b>

09:05.130 --> 09:08.710
<b>I demand a sacrifice! I demand a sacrifice!</b>

09:09.540 --> 09:10.420
<b>That way!</b>

09:12.960 --> 09:16.210
<b>That's weird. My searchlight didn't sense things properly?</b>

09:16.210 --> 09:17.710
<b>Has it ever sensed anything?</b>

09:21.500 --> 09:23.500
<b>I think he came this way somewhere...</b>

09:23.500 --> 09:26.830
<b>I demand a sacrifice! I demand a sacrifice!</b>

09:25.420 --> 09:26.830
<b>Hey, stop that!</b>

09:26.830 --> 09:29.580
<b>I demand a sacrifice! I demand a sacrifice!</b>

09:29.790 --> 09:31.330
<b>I demand a sacrifice!</b>

09:30.040 --> 09:31.330
<b>Tsukumo-kun?</b>

09:31.330 --> 09:33.130
<b>Faust!</b>

09:33.460 --> 09:35.580
<b>I demand a sacrifice!</b>

09:36.580 --> 09:38.210
<b>Thank goodness you survived!</b>

09:38.380 --> 09:40.040
<b>Way to go, Black!</b>

09:40.040 --> 09:42.080
<b>Are you crying a little?</b>

09:42.670 --> 09:47.330
<b>Of course not. My eyes just sting from
the winds blowing through the wasteland.</b>

09:44.210 --> 09:47.040
<b>Salty... and gross...</b>

09:47.710 --> 09:51.330
<b>If something's precious to you,
you best not let it out of your sight.</b>

09:51.330 --> 09:55.330
<b>You fiend! Don't tell me...
messing with Faust wasn't enough for you?!</b>

09:55.580 --> 09:58.330
<b>You intend to turn those kids to evil as well?!</b>

09:58.330 --> 09:59.920
<b>Hey, Big Bro?</b>

09:59.920 --> 10:01.040
<b>Hey.</b>

10:01.040 --> 10:02.080
<b>Hey...</b>

10:02.080 --> 10:03.130
<b>"Big Bro"?!</b>

10:04.330 --> 10:06.630
<b>They're my little sisters and little brother.</b>

10:07.750 --> 10:10.040
<b>S-so what's the matter?</b>

10:10.290 --> 10:15.630
<b>We were playing at the shrine in the woods, when
the trees started rustling and ghost eyes went "flash"!</b>

10:15.630 --> 10:17.380
<b>And we went, "eek!" and ran away...</b>

10:17.380 --> 10:19.750
<b>That ghost is gonna eat Benjamin...</b>

10:20.500 --> 10:21.880
<b>"Benjamin"?</b>

10:22.630 --> 10:24.000
<b>Our cat.</b>

10:24.380 --> 10:26.920
<b>It's a big calico cat with blue eyes.</b>

10:27.290 --> 10:30.420
<b>A giant, blue-eyed, tricolor feline?!</b>

10:31.460 --> 10:35.540
<b>If the foul beast I failed to seal away
in my previous life has been reincarnated,</b>

10:36.250 --> 10:38.920
<b>I must make sure to defeat it
this time with my own hands!</b>

10:39.290 --> 10:43.250
<b>Oh, and there's a little heart shape on the forehead.</b>

10:43.710 --> 10:45.290
<b>A heart on the forehead?!</b>

10:46.790 --> 10:50.040
<b>That's the cat Sora-chan adopts in episode eight of iLive!</b>

10:53.960 --> 10:56.670
<b>Hi kitty, are you all alone, too?</b>

11:00.460 --> 11:02.130
<b>You're just like me!</b>

11:07.130 --> 11:09.670
<b>That was an incredible episode...</b>

11:10.170 --> 11:13.170
<b>Sora-chan! I swear I'll protect your kitty!</b>

11:13.170 --> 11:15.420
<b>Benjamin's an important friend!</b>

11:16.880 --> 11:18.000
<b>"A friend"?!</b>

11:18.710 --> 11:23.880
<b>Don't worry! A friend of yours is a friend to us, too!
We'll save your cat no matter what!</b>

11:23.880 --> 11:25.170
<b>Right, Purple?!</b>

11:25.880 --> 11:26.880
<b>Noda...</b>

11:27.210 --> 11:30.210
<b>Let's go face the new enemy, together!</b>

11:30.880 --> 11:33.170
<b>These guys never disappoint...</b>

11:34.080 --> 11:35.880
<b>Okay, leave it to me.</b>

11:36.170 --> 11:37.710
<b>Your big bro's gonna take care of this.</b>

11:38.920 --> 11:42.210
<b>Faust, you protect the little ones.</b>

11:42.210 --> 11:47.540
<b>We have all five of us now!
Minakami High School Hero Club, here we go!</b>

11:47.960 --> 11:50.040
<b>Wait, you're counting me in this?!</b>

11:57.420 --> 11:59.330
<b>...I-I know that!</b>

11:59.330 --> 12:00.210
<b>Huh?</b>

12:01.830 --> 12:06.210
<b>I can settle this alone. You guys should stay,
if you know what's good for you.</b>

12:06.210 --> 12:07.170
<b>Purple?!</b>

12:09.290 --> 12:10.710
<b>Don't say I didn't warn you.</b>

12:13.880 --> 12:16.750
<b>I knew it. He's hiding something.</b>

12:16.750 --> 12:17.540
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:19.460 --> 12:21.080
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

12:22.670 --> 12:24.630
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

12:32.210 --> 12:35.880
<b>There have always been
ominous rumors about this shrine.</b>

12:36.130 --> 12:37.580
<b>You guys sure you can keep up?</b>

12:38.460 --> 12:40.080
<b>You okay there?</b>

12:40.080 --> 12:46.830
<b>It seems this forest has the curse of
the endless corridor... the Möbius... Loop!</b>

12:47.170 --> 12:51.630
<b>Black! Let's train together sometime!
We'll repel that curse!</b>

12:52.170 --> 12:55.000
<b>It really feels like something could
jump out at any second...</b>

12:55.210 --> 12:58.170
<b>Stop that! What if something really does jump out?</b>

12:58.420 --> 13:03.130
<b>What? You guys really don't sense
these spirits all around us?</b>

13:03.790 --> 13:06.380
<b>There's no way ghosts actually exist!</b>

13:07.460 --> 13:09.380
<b>There's one! A ghost!</b>

13:12.540 --> 13:13.380
<b>Nope.</b>

13:13.960 --> 13:15.420
<b>They're just banners.</b>

13:16.170 --> 13:17.380
<b>Don't scare us like that!</b>

13:17.380 --> 13:19.630
<b>Eeek! Another one!</b>

13:20.290 --> 13:21.670
<b>Just a stone statue.</b>

13:22.330 --> 13:29.330
<b>Watch your step!</b>

13:23.130 --> 13:24.920
<b>We're doomed! So doomed!</b>

13:25.000 --> 13:29.380
<b>We're doomed... Doomed... Doomed... Doomed...</b>

13:25.130 --> 13:26.790
<b>A rusty sign.</b>

13:26.790 --> 13:29.380
<b>Honestly! It's your fault this is scary, Takashima-kun!</b>

13:30.080 --> 13:31.920
<b>No wait, I sense something.</b>

13:33.420 --> 13:38.290
<b>It seems that vengeful spirits full of cursed hatred
are wandering these parts.</b>

13:40.580 --> 13:42.040
<b>Oh no, you don't!</b>

13:43.130 --> 13:44.830
<b><i>Rin-pyo-to-sha-kai-jin-retsu-zai-zen!</i></b>

13:45.670 --> 13:51.710
<b>Cursed beast of fiery hell, answer my call
in accordance with our ancient pact!</b>

13:55.670 --> 13:57.080
<b>Hell Servant!</b>

14:03.380 --> 14:10.330
<b>No soul can withstand the cruel and ruthless attack of
the Cerberus, summoned from the demon realm!</b>

14:11.000 --> 14:15.000
<b>Now, dance with Death to a rondo of despair!</b>

14:20.040 --> 14:21.330
<b>Nakamura-kun?</b>

14:22.210 --> 14:23.460
<b>That's it, keep going!</b>

14:23.460 --> 14:24.710
<b>What are you doing...?</b>

14:25.080 --> 14:26.670
<b>I've got your back!</b>

14:29.670 --> 14:33.830
<b>Diamond Tornado!</b>

14:36.130 --> 14:37.040
<b>Here we go!</b>

14:38.250 --> 14:40.960
<b>What exactly do these two think they see?</b>

14:41.580 --> 14:43.540
<b>Takashima-kun, do you see anything?</b>

14:43.540 --> 14:44.630
<b>Not really.</b>

14:45.460 --> 14:47.040
<b>They're not half bad.</b>

14:47.040 --> 14:47.880
<b>What?!</b>

14:47.880 --> 14:49.540
<b>Something's really out there?!</b>

14:49.540 --> 14:51.670
<b>Let's leave this up to them.</b>

14:51.790 --> 14:52.540
<b>You see something?!</b>

14:52.540 --> 14:54.540
<b>Am I the weird one here?! Which is it?!</b>

14:59.130 --> 15:02.960
<b>You all go on ahead! I'll hold this fiendish beast back!</b>

15:03.250 --> 15:05.540
<b>Don't let my death be in vain!</b>

15:06.420 --> 15:07.330
<b>Black!</b>

15:08.630 --> 15:14.460
<b>I'm not Black! My name... My name... is Toga Ryushoin!</b>

15:16.330 --> 15:19.380
<b>Let's go. Don't let his sacrifice go to waste!</b>

15:23.460 --> 15:24.460
<b>Nakamura-kun?!</b>

15:25.130 --> 15:26.420
<b>Don't look back!</b>

15:27.790 --> 15:29.040
<b>The idiot.</b>

15:32.540 --> 15:35.630
<b>Benjamin! Come on out!</b>

15:32.540 --> 15:38.500
<b>"This glowing season, precious memories with you..."</b>

15:38.880 --> 15:43.000
<b>Let's all sing together! Sora-chan's song will boost
our courage a hundredfold.</b>

15:43.460 --> 15:45.380
<b>Whatever. Just watch your step.</b>

15:45.790 --> 15:50.000
<b>Okay, fine. I'll show you how it's done,
so learn it properly, 'kay?</b>

15:50.000 --> 15:56.670
<b>"This glowing season, precious memories with you..."</b>

15:54.540 --> 15:56.420
<b>He's so scared he's gone off the deep end.</b>

15:58.380 --> 15:59.500
<b>Come on baby,</b>

15:59.500 --> 16:01.670
<b>I'll hold you in a clever embra-</b>

16:02.920 --> 16:04.670
<b>Sora-chan!</b>

16:04.920 --> 16:05.880
<b>Yellow!</b>

16:09.170 --> 16:10.330
<b>Takashima-kun!</b>

16:10.330 --> 16:13.330
<b>Are you all right?! Yellow? Yellow!</b>

16:15.000 --> 16:17.380
<b>Sora-chan, I'm always with you...</b>

16:18.380 --> 16:20.630
<b>He looked so happy as he fainted.</b>

16:20.790 --> 16:22.880
<b>Let's let him be for a bit.</b>

16:24.790 --> 16:27.750
<b>Keep up the stupid antics. I'm going on ahead.</b>

16:28.670 --> 16:30.000
<b>Oh hey, wait!</b>

16:30.420 --> 16:32.500
<b>We'll come get you later, okay?!</b>

16:43.080 --> 16:46.420
<b>It looks like it might rain.
Shouldn't we pick up the search later?</b>

16:46.920 --> 16:50.630
<b>I made a promise with them, that we'd rescue Benjamin.</b>

16:52.000 --> 16:52.920
<b>But also...</b>

16:53.170 --> 16:55.540
<b>Purple! We want to help you!</b>

16:55.750 --> 16:57.920
<b>So tell us your true identity!</b>

16:58.250 --> 16:58.920
<b>Huh?</b>

17:00.000 --> 17:02.290
<b>Black getting attacked by ghosts...</b>

17:02.540 --> 17:04.380
<b>Yellow losing himself...</b>

17:04.670 --> 17:06.580
<b>Was that all because of your powers?</b>

17:06.580 --> 17:07.210
<b>Uh?</b>

17:07.710 --> 17:10.040
<b>Huh, so you noticed.</b>

17:10.290 --> 17:11.330
<b>Uhh?!</b>

17:12.000 --> 17:16.710
<b>If you're the mastermind behind all this,
I need to fight you.</b>

17:17.170 --> 17:20.290
<b>But if someone's threatening you to do this
and you have no choice...</b>

17:23.670 --> 17:26.920
<b>You're the first one to discover this much about me.</b>

17:27.920 --> 17:31.080
<b>As a reward, let me show you the depth of my abilities!</b>

17:35.750 --> 17:36.540
<b>Huh?!</b>

17:43.380 --> 17:45.080
<b>Is that your doing, too?</b>

17:45.080 --> 17:46.710
<b>A-and what if it is?</b>

17:46.710 --> 17:50.380
<b>Are you scared?! And why are you hiding behind me?!</b>

17:50.380 --> 17:52.880
<b>I just thought I'd protect you, Hijiri-san.</b>

17:54.000 --> 17:55.330
<b>I found you.</b>

18:00.380 --> 18:02.130
<b>I thought you were going to protect me?!</b>

18:02.420 --> 18:05.040
<b>All right, then! You two make a break for it!</b>

18:05.040 --> 18:05.880
<b>Noda-kun!</b>

18:06.380 --> 18:08.130
<b>I'm your opponent!</b>

18:11.880 --> 18:13.670
<b>No way... Noda-kun!</b>

18:14.210 --> 18:18.250
<b>What IS that? I'm so scared! No way!
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry...</b>

18:18.250 --> 18:21.580
<b>Uh, Tsukumo-kun?! You're acting totally out of character.</b>

18:22.790 --> 18:24.250
<b>No way, no way, no way...</b>

18:24.250 --> 18:25.580
<b>I got you...</b>

18:27.210 --> 18:29.130
<b>I'm so sorry!</b>

18:30.460 --> 18:32.290
<b>You little miscreants!</b>

18:32.290 --> 18:33.380
<b>Huh?</b>

18:34.830 --> 18:36.000
<b>Benjamin!</b>

18:41.330 --> 18:42.630
<b>Benjamin!</b>

18:43.330 --> 18:45.210
<b>Thanks, Big Bro!</b>

18:45.420 --> 18:47.630
<b>Ha. It was nothing.</b>

18:49.670 --> 18:54.500
<b>Thank you for rescuing Benjamin!
I didn't realize you were Big Bro's friends!</b>

18:54.670 --> 18:56.250
<b>Uh no, I'm-</b>

18:56.500 --> 19:01.210
<b>We're protectors of the peace, the Minakami High School
Hero Club. We're all comrades!</b>

19:01.210 --> 19:02.630
<b>Right, Purple?</b>

19:04.000 --> 19:06.710
<b>Fine, I'll say I am for now.</b>

19:07.170 --> 19:10.710
<b>The Benjamin rescue mission is hereby complete!</b>

19:13.420 --> 19:14.710
<b>Rei, you're late!</b>

19:17.000 --> 19:18.710
<b>B-Big Sis...</b>

19:19.330 --> 19:20.670
<b>"Big Sis"?</b>

19:21.210 --> 19:24.170
<b>Dude, how many siblings do you have?</b>

19:24.330 --> 19:26.170
<b>I called you a bunch of times!</b>

19:26.420 --> 19:28.500
<b>Will you get on with making dinner?</b>

19:28.830 --> 19:30.920
<b>I want tofu hamburger steak.</b>

19:31.750 --> 19:33.710
<b>Actually, today I-</b>

19:34.170 --> 19:36.420
<b>What? You have a problem with that?</b>

19:37.580 --> 19:39.380
<b>It's nothing...</b>

19:44.500 --> 19:50.330
<b>I-I... uh... my powers...</b>

19:50.330 --> 19:53.960
<b>Uh, yeah... Sorry about this...</b>

19:54.460 --> 19:55.630
<b>Don't apologize!</b>

19:56.290 --> 19:59.830
<b>Yup! Nothing! We saw nothing!</b>

19:59.960 --> 20:04.330
<b>Indeed. I shall cast the memory removal
Eraser on everyone, so don't worry.</b>

20:04.540 --> 20:08.830
<b>If anything, I like you better now.
You have things tough, huh?</b>

20:09.040 --> 20:12.460
<b>Yeah. You know... Hang in there!</b>

20:12.710 --> 20:16.540
<b>Stop it! Don't look at me with pitying eyes!</b>

20:24.830 --> 20:27.380
<b>Put your heart into sweeping and cleansing the place.</b>

20:27.630 --> 20:28.750
<b>All right!</b>

20:30.210 --> 20:33.710
<b>Seriously, making such a fuss at your age...</b>

20:40.790 --> 20:42.460
<b>You're pretty strong, old man!</b>

20:42.880 --> 20:44.580
<b>You're not so bad yourself.</b>

20:44.960 --> 20:49.250
<b>Keep those hands moving, everyone.
This is to make up for the hassle we caused.</b>

20:49.750 --> 20:51.880
<b>Hmph. Why should I have to do this too?</b>

20:53.920 --> 20:58.630
<b>There you go drinking coffee again when you hate it.
Don't blame me if your stomach gets upset.</b>

20:59.130 --> 21:00.880
<b>Hey! Don't give it away!</b>

21:00.880 --> 21:01.710
<b>What?</b>

21:05.790 --> 21:09.380
<b>You mean your stomach was in pain back there?</b>

21:10.460 --> 21:15.880
<b>All that shady stuff you said,
you were just covering up normal stuff?</b>

21:16.420 --> 21:19.040
<b>You guys just read into what I said.</b>

21:19.960 --> 21:21.960
<b>You sure ran away with it though...</b>

21:22.380 --> 21:24.250
<b>You've got it tough, huh?</b>

21:25.460 --> 21:27.250
<b>I keep getting dragged into their stuff.</b>

21:27.250 --> 21:29.210
<b>No, that's not it.</b>

21:29.210 --> 21:31.420
<b>Huh? What do you mean?</b>

21:32.250 --> 21:34.670
<b>Fine, we'll leave it at that for now.</b>

21:41.170 --> 21:42.710
<b>He's coming back, huh?</b>

21:43.380 --> 21:46.670
<b>We might not be able to relax for long.</b>

21:57.380 --> 21:59.080
<b>I'm here, Japan.</b>

22:00.420 --> 22:03.170
<b>Sorry for the wait, Nippon.</b>

22:04.040 --> 22:08.710
<b>A vivid melody shrouded in a seasonal wind</b>

22:08.710 --> 22:11.790
<b>Calls to me</b>

22:12.040 --> 22:19.250
<b>Rhythm overflows, accelerating the sound of footsteps</b>

22:19.670 --> 22:27.500
<b>Let's go look for something we'll never
get with our heads hanging down</b>

22:27.670 --> 22:37.750
<b>If I go with you, I'm sure we can leap over the highest of walls</b>

22:38.170 --> 22:40.460
<b>Let's get started! All right?</b>

22:40.790 --> 22:44.710
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

22:44.710 --> 22:47.920
<b>On those wings you illustrated</b>

22:47.920 --> 22:51.710
<b>Keep flying, and to a story</b>

22:51.960 --> 22:56.580
<b>We'll soar through tomorrow</b>

22:56.580 --> 23:00.710
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

23:00.710 --> 23:04.040
<b>That heartbeat that won't disappear</b>

23:04.040 --> 23:07.960
<b>Keep trying, and to a story</b>

23:07.960 --> 23:11.630
<b>Harmonies overlap</b>

23:11.790 --> 23:17.420
<b>The image of the future that doesn't belong to anyone</b>

23:17.790 --> 23:22.790
<b>I'll draw it, with you</b>

23:26.670 --> 23:29.170
<b>Early this morning, I accomplished the miraculous feat</b>

23:27.250 --> 23:28.670
<b>Next episode preview ☆</b>

23:29.170 --> 23:31.500
<b>of having fifteen relationships at once
</b><b>in Moegaoka ☆ High School!</b><b></b>

23:30.670 --> 23:32.170
<b>Feeling awesome!</b>

23:31.500 --> 23:32.040
<b>Yeah?</b>

23:32.040 --> 23:34.380
<b>And they're going to have a vinyl wrapped car
with my lovely Sora-chan on it!</b>

23:33.040 --> 23:34.040
<b>Uh-huh...</b>

23:33.040 --> 23:33.790
<b>Okay...</b>

23:33.040 --> 23:34.420
<b>Oh, really.</b>

23:33.040 --> 23:34.920
<b>Wow (totally insincere)</b>

23:34.380 --> 23:35.880
<b>Oh, and we're getting a transfer student!</b>

23:35.880 --> 23:36.830
<b>Not interested.</b>

23:37.380 --> 23:40.040
<b>Next episode: "I've Got a Complication,
There's a Fanfare in My Head."</b>
